@node Top
@top Valsi

Valsi is an Emacs client/server harness for the structured markdown artifacts
agents read and write.  Grammars are @emph{descriptive} --- tolerant
recognizers over plain markdown that annotate but never reject --- so every
file stays ordinary, diffable, and portable.

